<title>USA: ACM Managed Dollar increased monthly div.</title>
<headline>ACM Managed Dollar increased monthly div.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>ACM Managed Dollar Income Fund Inc said it raised its monthly dividend to $0.1125 from $0.1050.</p>
<p>The dividend is to be paid on March 21 to shareholders of record on March 7.</p>
</text>
